-           - Multiply `acc` by `color`.
-           - $direction = \text{cos\_weighted\_hemisphere}(n)$ [S2, unofficial].
-   - **Russian Roulette / Depth Increment:**
-     - Increment `bounces` by 1 [S2, unofficial].
